            "review_title": "Review at Tiệm Vịt Quay Minh Thiên",
            "review_text": "Юлия У\n12 contributions\n0\nDuck, this is something special!!!\nNov 2025 • Couples\nReturning from the cable car accidentally saw the completion and decided to try,all the dishes at an affordable price, while everything is clean, sofas,treated free cold oolong tea(while waiting for the order) took and soup 60 dong(the noodles taste better than rice, like homemade with lagman),and vegetables and dumplings 60 dong - all just delicious!!! We are thrilled, we will definitely come back and tell our own in the hotel, also the employee advised the second point and she was closer to us by free bus (near the airport) Thank you very much from Belarus\nRead more\nTranslated from Russian\nShow original\nWritten November 30, 2025",
