            "review_text": "James G\n4 contributions\n0\nExceptional Duck!!\nMar 2024 • Couples\nBRILLIANT restaurant selling Peking Duck dishes.\n\nI’m shocked this place isn’t higher up the TripAdvisor ranks.\n\nSet up is minimal, but very cute! You can tell in the quality of the food that the owner really cares about his dishes. What is really special about this place is that all the dishes revolve around one main ingredient, a simple idea with incredible results!\n\nA definite recommend for any trip to Phu Quoc, especially for duck fans, even though it is a little bit off the beaten track! This place is filled with locals.\n\nI’d recommend getting the duck with noodles (and obviously, a peking duck!)\nRead more\nWritten March 28, 2024",
